WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:10.720
Just wondering. did we make this
more complicated than it had to be?

2
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:13.260
We could've easily killed them
then 'n' there.

3
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:15.320
Damn. how dense can you be?

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.730
Fighting them would've woken up the
boss. and our big payday would be gone.

5
00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.190
That piece of crap E-Rank's
as weak as he is mopey.

6
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:27.830
Be a miracle for him and a D-Rank
without raid experience to beat that spider.

7
00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:32.870
Once it eats 'em. it'll pass right back out.
and we can sneak in and claim our crystals.

8
00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:35.340
I could break through
the cave-in with my magic.

9
00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.240
Any explosion will wake the spider.

10
00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:41.840
There were side tunnels
near the ceiling.

11
00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.510
We'll drop in from there.

12
00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.010
And the dots all connect.

13
00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:47.720
Man. awesome idea.

14
00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.550
But what if the spider's awake?

15
00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:53.180
We'll chalk it up to bad luck
and take the damn thing out.

16
00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.400
Either way. we're gonna come
out of this better than we went in.

17
00:00:56.480 --> 00:01:00.230
Jinho's sword and shield alone
must be worth a few hundred million.

18
00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:03.860
If we can't nab all the mana crystals.
his gear will have to do.

19
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.570
So let's figure out
whose trust fund kid he is.

20
00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.070
Would look bad if I didn't show
at the funeral.

21
00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:12.910
And you know without a doubt
those two were torn limb from limb

22
00:01:12.990 --> 00:01:14.580
after our "noisy demolition".

23
00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:17.880
A grumpy monster spider
can't be a good time.

24
00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:22.170
Kyuhwan. Think you could take
that nasty bastard down yourself?

25
00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.960
Yeah. right. maybe in
my wildest dreams.

26
00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:28.810
I feel the same.
It's a beast of a magic beast.

27
00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.090
So. yeah.
They're as good as dead.

28
00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:37.560
That's the one part of my plan
that's an absolute guarantee.

29
00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:42.020
Get serious! You'd have to be at least
a B-Rank to kill that on your own!

30
00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:45.160
Or an upper C-Rank. which I'll
remind you is two ranks above you!

31
00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:47.290
The odds are like zero. bro.

32
00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:50.660
Let's focus our energy
on escaping instead!

33
00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.860
Jinho has a point.

34
00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:56.040
Even though I reawakened
and leveled up a few times.

35
00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:57.800
I'm still pretty weak.

36
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:04.930
The blue venom-fanged kasaka I fought in
the instance dungeon was probably D-Rank.

37
00:02:05.010 --> 00:02:08.010
Bet that golem was as well.
if not lower.

38
00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:12.340
This thing's easily uglier
than both of them.

39
00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:15.230
and safe to assume
it's stronger. too.

40
00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:17.560
And yet somehow.

41
00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:20.810
the thought of fighting it
doesn't intimidate me.

42
00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:24.100
I can stand my ground
against a C-Rank boss.

43
00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:26.080
I'm strong enough for that.

44
00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.620
I'm level eighteen now.

45
00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:33.990
Taking on this thing.

46
00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.670
Is worth a shot!

47
00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:44.850
They call us hunters for a reason.

48
00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:48.980
And it's about time
the real hunt begins!

49
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:56.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

50
00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:30.190
Long day. sir?

51
00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:33.020
Seems these meetings
are beginning to wear on me.

52
00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:35.080
They are on an endless loop.

53
00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:39.160
The government. media. and
energy developers all wanna talk.

54
00:04:39.240 --> 00:04:43.160
It's ironic. because I didn't
used to be much of a talker.

55
00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:50.290
Thankfully. your schedule
is clear for the time being.

56
00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:54.500
As such. would it be all right
if I asked for some instruction?

57
00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.430
Could be a good change of pace.
Less talking. too.

58
00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:03.470
They say old soldiers
are doomed to fade away.

59
00:05:03.550 --> 00:05:07.650
but I can hardly turn down a
youngster asking for a bit of guidance.

60
00:05:17.030 --> 00:05:18.540
That's one tough shell.

61
00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:23.990
And it hits hard.

62
00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.920
A single strike could kill me.

63
00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:36.050
The way he's moving.
he can't possibly be E-Rank!

64
00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:37.600
So what is he?

65
00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:42.390
Huh? Did he fake his ranking?

66
00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:44.850
It's not unheard of.

67
00:05:44.930 --> 00:05:47.020
Some hunters have
exceptional magic control

68
00:05:47.100 --> 00:05:49.440
and make it so they're ranked
lower when they register.

69
00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.190
which earns them
the name "false rankers!"

70
00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:55.200
Most turn out to be lunatics.

71
00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:57.870
The kind of psychopaths
who kill for fun!

72
00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.610
What am I even doing in this place?

73
00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:06.210
Dad. I'm so sorry.

74
00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:14.800
Damn! I still haven't done
any actual damage!

75
00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:20.430
And with high fatigue. I'm
about to get real slow real fast.

76
00:06:20.510 --> 00:06:22.630
I've gotta kill it
before that happens!

77
00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:25.390
Paralysis and drain.

78
00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.900
The dagger's debuffs
are my key to victory!

79
00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.940
I just need a weak spot to aim for.

80
00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:32.440
Gotcha!

81
00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:41.280
Acid? Well. aren't you
full of nasty surprises!

82
00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:45.710
This freak has rock-solid armor.
and spit that burns to the bone?

83
00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:49.460
And the longer we fight.
the worse off I'll be.

84
00:06:50.080 --> 00:06:53.500
I have to get up close.
regardless of the risk.

85
00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:55.800
A new skill. Dash.

86
00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:59.010
Perfect. let's take it for a spin!

87
00:07:12.220 --> 00:07:14.060
If one hit won't cut it.

88
00:07:14.140 --> 00:07:16.320
I'll just keep slicing away!

89
00:07:18.320 --> 00:07:19.940
Whoa. he's fast!

90
00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.650
But does he have
the stamina to hang in there?

91
00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:24.570
What's his strategy?

92
00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:29.000
Faster.

93
00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:31.750
Go even faster!

94
00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:35.670
Almost there!

95
00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:37.050
Huh?

96
00:07:40.750 --> 00:07:42.300
Oh. no! Jinwoo!

97
00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.780
You can't die like this!

98
00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:50.830
Man. am I glad I sat on those
daily quest rewards until now.

99
00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:54.660
That could've ended
very differently otherwise.

100
00:08:56.960 --> 00:08:58.710
I don't believe it.

101
00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:01.750
He totally thrashed
that thing by himself!

102
00:09:02.830 --> 00:09:04.500
Then it's true.

103
00:09:04.580 --> 00:09:07.140
This guy is a false ranker!

104
00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:11.260
Hmm. Wonder how much
this'll go for.

105
00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:14.180
Hey. um. B-Boss?

106
00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:17.900
If you'd like. I can hold all of
the essence stones you get.

107
00:09:17.980 --> 00:09:20.900
I'd also be more than happy
to take care of your gear.

108
00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.110
Thirsty. boss?
Please. help yourself.

109
00:09:23.190 --> 00:09:24.650
I insist.

110
00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:26.870
Uh. sure.

111
00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:28.910
Why's he calling me that?

112
00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:30.660
Sit back and rest up. boss!

113
00:09:30.740 --> 00:09:33.620
I'll excavate the mana crystals
while you recharge!

114
00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:37.010
What has gotten into him?

115
00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.090
No. They're alive?

116
00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.060
Are you all right?

117
00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.410
I am. Thank you
for the lesson. sir.

118
00:10:06.490 --> 00:10:09.660
I should thank you since this
was a good change of pace.

119
00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:11.450
So thanks. Jinchul.

120
00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:15.750
Remarkable. You don't seem
to have lost a step.

121
00:10:15.830 --> 00:10:19.750
No. I have compared to
when I was on active duty.

122
00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:23.080
What's really remarkable is how
much your defense has improved.

123
00:10:23.160 --> 00:10:25.090
It shows you've been practicing.

124
00:10:25.170 --> 00:10:28.430
Though I know my rank is set in
stone. there's nothing preventing me

125
00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:30.930
from honing my body and technique.

126
00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:34.970
Mm. It's important for hunters
to work on their minds and bodies

127
00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:37.350
and not solely rely on their gifts.

128
00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:41.110
Especially. since they're caught
in dire situations quite frequently.

129
00:10:41.770 --> 00:10:47.870
It's in those same situations. that human
nature rears its ugly head to truly test you.

130
00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:50.400
So you did squash the spider.

131
00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:54.070
Guess it was just an overgrown
bug and not an overpowered monster.

132
00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:57.580
I'm sure that dude's gear made
beating a C-Rank boss a cinch.

133
00:10:57.660 --> 00:11:01.710
He's a D-Rank. though. Thing must've
been weak as hell for him to kill it.

134
00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:03.960
So what's the call?
Just say the word.

135
00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.880
I would think it's obvious.

136
00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.840
Jinho Yoo!

137
00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:11.800
Those fancy toys of yours got
me curious. so I did a little digging.

138
00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:15.600
Your old man's the head of
Yoojin Construction. Myunghan Yoo.

139
00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:16.890
Isn't that right?

140
00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:20.020
Huh? Well. and so what if it is?

141
00:11:20.100 --> 00:11:22.020
It's earned you a chance.

142
00:11:22.640 --> 00:11:24.810
Kill Jinwoo and you'll live.

143
00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:27.940
Surely the pieces have clicked.

144
00:11:28.020 --> 00:11:30.150
We round out our numbers
with dumb chumps.

145
00:11:30.230 --> 00:11:33.240
They all die. and we keep
their share of the loot.

146
00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:36.660
And now. you're gonna be
our accomplice. Jinho Yoo.

147
00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:38.750
That's the only way
you're leaving alive.

148
00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.330
You're kidding.

149
00:11:40.410 --> 00:11:44.620
Trust fund baby's first boss fight
was cake thanks to his special gear.

150
00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.170
Could be a real pain to deal with.

151
00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.550
Save yourself and kill him.

152
00:11:49.630 --> 00:11:51.340
Or you can both die.

153
00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:55.180
Come on. Not like it's a hard choice.

154
00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:58.560
What happens in a dungeon
stays in a dungeon.

155
00:11:58.640 --> 00:12:02.440
Don't tell me a D-Rank
is afraid of an E-Rank loser.

156
00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:20.250
Huh?

157
00:12:21.120 --> 00:12:22.370
Wow.

158
00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:25.210
You're actually siding
with the deadweight?

159
00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.090
So are we cooking
the golden goose. too. or what?

160
00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:32.380
We'll take out the weak one first.

161
00:12:33.130 --> 00:12:34.500
Say. fellas.

162
00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:38.060
Ever killed a human before?
In cold blood?

163
00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.100
Huh?

164
00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:45.520
Wh... Urgent quest?

165
00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:47.400
What the hell is this?

166
00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:50.070
I would pay attention if I were you!

167
00:12:58.530 --> 00:12:59.870
Boss!

168
00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:07.050
Hey. Heejin!

169
00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:11.920
It's been a while.

170
00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.710
How're things down at
the White Tiger Guild lately?

171
00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:18.220
It's business as usual.
Nothing really to report.

172
00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.260
Any big news
out of the Hunter's Guild?

173
00:13:20.340 --> 00:13:22.890
Nah. it's been
fairly normal for us too.

174
00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.690
Wait a second.
How'd that training go?

175
00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:28.270
Miss Cha led you through
an A-Rank dungeon. right?

176
00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:29.810
That's not normal.

177
00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:31.440
It was certainly something.

178
00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:33.440
A fast something.

179
00:13:33.520 --> 00:13:36.870
Our entire squad was struggling
against an A-Rank beast.

180
00:13:41.650 --> 00:13:43.910
Then Miss Cha slayed it in a flash.

181
00:13:44.570 --> 00:13:46.920
Made it look like it was
no big deal. either.

182
00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.250
She took as all by surprise.

183
00:13:49.330 --> 00:13:52.010
but Kihoon was just
completely bowled over.

184
00:13:53.210 --> 00:13:56.390
He wants to be a strike team
captain. so it opened his eyes.

185
00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:58.260
Yeah. he is pretty straight-laced.

186
00:13:58.340 --> 00:14:00.590
What about that Chul Kim guy
from your guild?

187
00:14:00.670 --> 00:14:03.640
Heard he also wants to be
a captain. Can he hack it?

188
00:14:03.720 --> 00:14:06.150
He's not a bad guy
and he has potential. but...

189
00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:09.480
But that one little word
tells us everything.

190
00:14:09.560 --> 00:14:12.980
Guildmates aside.
think of how fortunate we are.

191
00:14:13.060 --> 00:14:15.320
The guilds we joined
are the best of the best.

192
00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:17.360
We're in the big leagues. ladies.

193
00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:20.110
-That's very true.
-Mm-hmm.

194
00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:24.820
I'd hate to freelance. especially with the
unsavory rumors I've heard floating around.

195
00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:26.870
Rumors like what?

196
00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.330
Like. you know.

197
00:14:28.410 --> 00:14:31.380
Strike teams with suspiciously
high fatality rates.

198
00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:37.430
Get a grip. kid.
Your friend is dead.

199
00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.640
You murderers!

200
00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.090
How could I have forgotten?

201
00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:48.440
It's survival of the fittest
in this world.

202
00:14:48.520 --> 00:14:53.610
This world filled with violence.
deception. and betrayal.

203
00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:59.860
How could I?
How? How? How?

204
00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:04.580
How? How? How?
How? How? How? How?

205
00:15:05.830 --> 00:15:09.620
That's right. I got numb to it.

206
00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:14.670
Careless. overconfident. delusional.

207
00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:21.800
And now. the system expects
me to murder my enemies.

208
00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:26.730
Does it need to keep me alive
for some reason?

209
00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:29.560
This isn't coincidence or charity.

210
00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.980
The system wants me to live.

211
00:15:34.390 --> 00:15:35.690
Huh?

212
00:15:37.980 --> 00:15:40.360
It wants me strong.

213
00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:42.820
Gosh. you sure know
how to take a hit. don't you?

214
00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:45.840
"A hit?"
The dude took a deathblow.

215
00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:49.540
I think I get it now.

216
00:15:51.280 --> 00:15:54.120
If the system is bent on using me.

217
00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:57.130
I'm just gonna have
to use the system.

218
00:15:57.210 --> 00:15:59.840
Kyuhwan. you idiot.
You shouldn't have held back.

219
00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:03.760
Thanks for the reminder.

220
00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:07.600
The weak always lose. no matter what.
That's the way it is.

221
00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.470
Somebody get this guy a medal.

222
00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:12.680
The Weakest Hunter
of All Mankind understands!

223
00:16:12.760 --> 00:16:17.780
I do. Your crew must understand
how it works. too. if you're saying that.

224
00:16:17.860 --> 00:16:20.400
Hang on.
What crap are you talking?

225
00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:22.570
You hunt and hunt.

226
00:16:23.900 --> 00:16:28.250
So now I want to know if the
hunters are ready to be preyed upon.

227
00:16:29.570 --> 00:16:32.240
Hey. boss. I'mma handle this one.

228
00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:35.790
Okay. listen up. pal.
You need a reality check.

229
00:16:36.750 --> 00:16:39.050
Are we "ready to be preyed upon"?

230
00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:42.460
And just what can a jumped-up
little E-Rank like you even do?

231
00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:45.590
I mean. you're the
Weakest Hunter of--

232
00:16:57.230 --> 00:16:58.520
That's one down.

233
00:16:58.600 --> 00:16:59.820
J-Juntae!

234
00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:01.270
What the hell. man?

235
00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:02.940
When did he draw that dagger?

236
00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:04.940
Where was he even hiding it?

237
00:17:05.020 --> 00:17:08.120
Arrogance aside. Juntae
was stronger than him!

238
00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.710
How could an E-Rank kill a D-Rank?

239
00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.040
I just killed somebody.

240
00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.960
A person.

241
00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:21.290
Even if I say
the system made me do it.

242
00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:25.310
I still ended a man's life.

243
00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:29.970
But it's either their lives or mine.

244
00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:32.310
So I can't back down now.

245
00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:36.820
Because it's only the strong
who survive!

246
00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.780
Go to hell!

247
00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.250
What kind of E-Rank moves like that?

248
00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:54.660
Son of a bitch!

249
00:17:59.540 --> 00:18:01.880
-Kyuhwan!
-Oh. um. right!

250
00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:10.560
Die!

251
00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:19.570
He's so strong.

252
00:18:20.180 --> 00:18:24.230
And he seems even more powerful
than when he fought the dungeon boss.

253
00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:27.610
You killed all five of my men
within seconds.

254
00:18:27.690 --> 00:18:30.320
Bet you also took out
the spider. huh?

255
00:18:30.400 --> 00:18:33.410
You kept your true strength
hidden from us!

256
00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:37.920
Though I'm C-Rank like they were.
my Reinforcement sets me apart!

257
00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:48.090
He's a monster in his own right. but
after fighting a boss and five hunters.

258
00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.600
he has to be tired.

259
00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:54.680
His speed and his dagger's special
abilities are what give him an edge.

260
00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:58.390
But my Reinforcement skill
makes my body as strong as steel!

261
00:18:58.470 --> 00:19:00.690
His attacks won't affect me!

262
00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:08.700
Mister Hwang. you're impressive.

263
00:19:09.570 --> 00:19:12.990
But I'm afraid I've got some
bad news for you.

264
00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:21.630
You see. I've been leveling up
this whole time.

265
00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:24.790
Wha-What just happened?

266
00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:28.300
I think he smashed me
into the ground with one hand.

267
00:19:28.380 --> 00:19:32.260
He lied. 'cause no way in hell
is he E-Rank!

268
00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:36.770
Wait! Even a monster like you has to
have a heart. so show mercy and spare me!

269
00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:40.140
You can take every mana crystal and
essence stone this dungeon has to offer!

270
00:19:40.220 --> 00:19:41.890
In fact. I'll pay you on top of that!

271
00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:45.990
Name any price you want to spare my life. and
I swear I'll double it no matter what it is!

272
00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:48.450
-Two times whatever you want!
-Three times.

273
00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:52.240
You tried to kill me
three times. didn't you?

274
00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:54.740
And now you want mercy?

275
00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.450
Yes! But for yourself!

276
00:19:56.530 --> 00:19:59.450
You'll never get away with it
if you kill me here!

277
00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:02.870
"What happens in
a dungeon stays in a dungeon."

278
00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.630
Your words. not mine.

279
00:20:05.490 --> 00:20:09.260
Bastard! If you had any idea
who my younger broth--

280
00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.480
With the boss dead.
the gate's closing.

281
00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.070
We have to go.

282
00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:35.030
Mm?!

283
00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:39.080
So all four C-Rank hunters
plus two D-Ranks died in action.

284
00:20:39.160 --> 00:20:43.450
and the only survivors were a D-Rank
on his first raid and some rando E-Rank?

285
00:20:43.530 --> 00:20:46.720
I know it sounds crazy. but it's true.

286
00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.800
-I believe you!
-Oh! Do you?

287
00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:54.880
Your blade. it's the Maya Company's Kalion
Longsword! It only just hit the shelves!

288
00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:57.350
Yeah. that's quite an eye you have.

289
00:20:57.430 --> 00:20:59.970
Rewards for slaughtering people.

290
00:21:00.050 --> 00:21:02.270
The Murderous Intent skill?

291
00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:07.150
Cuts enemy abilities
by 50% for a minute.

292
00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:10.520
Yeah. of course. you'd live if you
had so much awesome equipment!

293
00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:14.190
You must've been the hero of
this tragic tale. while this E-Rank hid

294
00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:17.660
and let you handle everything
by yourself. Am I right?

295
00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:20.280
Well. gentlemen. I appreciate

296
00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:22.870
your cooperation after going
through such a disaster.

297
00:21:22.950 --> 00:21:24.580
You are free to leave now.

298
00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:28.210
E-Excuse me.

299
00:21:28.290 --> 00:21:30.340
That was some
excellent work today. boss!

300
00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:31.880
I really mean it!

301
00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:34.720
Thanks.

302
00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:43.260
Is there anything wrong?

303
00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:44.730
No.

304
00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:47.440
I was just thinking.

305
00:21:47.520 --> 00:21:49.820
I'm glad I gave her that umbrella.

306
00:21:50.305 --> 00:22:50.929
